  "appreciation": "此诗为孟郊悼念修道亡友之作，意象凄寒，情感沉痛。首联以“众毒蔓贞松”起兴，隐喻高洁之士遭际险恶与早逝。颔联“春色舍芳蕙，秋风遶枯茎”以春去秋来的自然衰败，映照友人生前才华与死后枯槁。颈联“弹琴不成曲”化用伯牙绝弦之典，将知音难觅的孤寂与骤失挚友的悲怆交融。尾联“波浪送铭旌”以江上孤舟与波浪送葬的旷远之景作结，将无尽哀愁寄托于浩渺江波之中，言有尽而意无穷，尽显孟郊诗清冷峭拔、凄苦入骨之风。",
  "english": "Various poisons creep upon the steadfast pine, / A single branch cannot long flourish in its prime. / Who could have foreseen that the guest of the Yellow Court, / Would fail to form the immortal bones of a divine. / Spring colors forsake the fragrant orchids, / Autumn winds encircle the withered stems. / Strumming the zither, no tune can be formed, / Only then does one realize the true listener has fallen. / The moon at the lodge alters its former light, / Mourners express their lingering grief. / Returning by boat on the empty river, / The waves carry away the burial banner.",
